{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>Threads今日（18日）流傳一段影片，長約2分半鐘。帖主表示，同日凌晨2時46分，目擊到深水埗福榮街「有單位貓貓走咗出外面簷篷」，主人無法救貓，所以報案和通知愛協，「起初見雲梯上到5樓左右，之後貓貓應該跳高咗，雲梯再上升」，見到消防架起雲梯「上到7層樓高左右」，「15分鐘左右貓貓成功獲救」，「辛苦晒消防員」。</p><p>影片可見，消防升起雲梯，隨後降落到地面，消防手持貓籠，相信該隻貓隻正在籠內，同袍前來看貓。事件引來途人圍觀，甚至取出手機拍攝。</p><p>消防和警方今日凌晨1時53分左右接報指，有一隻貓在深水埗福榮街37至39號大廈外牆位置，消防通知愛協到場支援。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防升起雲梯。（Threads@jackieming影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199608766878715904687159.jpeg/giBcr1WU9jp_REtZ-lHkLtsXvS7hNY3pLzmvjS85r40\"/><figcaption>消防升起雲梯。（Threads@jackieming影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"慢慢降落到地面。（Threads@jackieming影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199608815532642304146873.jpeg/8cXTzl2BEsC_bhAuSQsVwcVSCe82QILAsxX2abMV9mk\"/><figcaption>慢慢降落到地面。（Threads@jackieming影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"慢慢降落到地面。（Threads@jackieming影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199608856674570240213756.jpeg/LMuawv6gC9I3-bmYYOeDSe7yH5lVthHJpXJMSKVyTEg\"/><figcaption>慢慢降落到地面。（Threads@jackieming影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防手持貓籠。（Threads@jackieming影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199609639730155520261705.jpeg/r7oOqVmkHfIorOAMDYFiT9PyLKY1mzKluXebSrl3m0o\"/><figcaption>消防手持貓籠。（Threads@jackieming影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"同袍前來看貓。（Threads@jackieming影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199609687905931264948652.jpeg/GfS1K1I5gFSgDy_O8b4zbnz56ka7KqylWx4p21seKds\"/><figcaption>同袍前來看貓。（Threads@jackieming影片截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T22:53:22.599435+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":439,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T22:35:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T03:52:45.903197+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T22:46:52.192187+00:00","content_hash":"4e91a45256b7a3d4af381adaf02b630e4407da19528d4f5f1